"The folder and the %ld item(s) inside it will be removed from every synced browser. Each browser's bookmark file is backed up before it is written, and the removed items are kept in the \"Deleted by BookmarkSync\" folder." = "La carpeta y los elementos que contiene (%ld) se eliminarán de todos los navegadores sincronizados. Antes de escribir se crea una copia del archivo de marcadores de cada navegador, y los elementos eliminados se guardan en la carpeta «Deleted by BookmarkSync».";
"The bookmark will be removed from every synced browser. Each browser's bookmark file is backed up before it is written, and the removed bookmark is kept in the \"Deleted by BookmarkSync\" folder." = "El marcador se eliminará de todos los navegadores sincronizados. Antes de escribir se crea una copia del archivo de marcadores de cada navegador, y el marcador eliminado se guarda en la carpeta «Deleted by BookmarkSync».";
